default /ok      200 OK | fine /ok
default /throw   500 Internal Server Error | Internal Server Error
default /reject  500 Internal Server Error | Internal Server Error
default /string  500 Internal Server Error | Internal Server Error
default /used    200 OK | 
onError /throw   502 Bad Gateway | custom: RangeError: handler exploded
onError /string  502 Bad Gateway | custom: TypeError: serve handler did not return a Response
onError /ok      200 OK | fine /ok
onError throws 500 Internal Server Error | Internal Server Error
